## Standing instruction KPR-PREFIX-CARRIER-V1

This workspace is driven by the installed kaola-project-runner Skill at
`.kpr/skills/kaola-project-runner/SKILL.md`. That Skill's full text is loaded
into your context at session start. If at any point your context no longer
contains the Skill's full text — for example after a context compaction — you
MUST read the file again before performing any runner work, then proceed.
